  <description>An &lt;img&gt; that is the sole content of a &lt;button&gt; or &lt;a&gt; element must have alt text describing the action the control performs, not the visual appearance of the image, so screen readers announce an actionable label (WCAG SC 1.1.1 Non-text Content, Level A).</description>
